# Project Stack

Local **home renovation contractor** marketing site for True Ridge Construction — kitchen, bathroom, basement remodels, and fireplace installs. Serving Salt Lake County and Utah County. All user-facing copy follows the `contractor-copy` rule.

## Tech Stack

- **Next.js 15** (App Router) — static generation by default
- **React** + **TypeScript**
- **Tailwind CSS** — all styling; no CSS modules or inline styles unless necessary
- **EmailJS** — contact form submissions (client component only)

## Project Structure

```
app/           → routes, layouts, metadata
components/    → reusable React components (ui/, sections/, forms/)
lib/           → utilities, constants, SEO helpers
public/        → static assets (favicon, og images)
```

## General Conventions

- Prefer **Server Components**; add `"use client"` only for interactivity (forms, mobile nav, carousels)
- One component per file; PascalCase filenames matching the export
- Colocate section-specific components in `components/sections/`
- Env vars for EmailJS use `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix; never commit `.env.local`
